Z||000006||Patrick||09-05-2000||12:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Can I replace it with just steel lines...?<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Sure, but plan on replacing it again within a few miles. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>There are sections of the line which are flexible for good reason. Vibration and movement of the engine/transaxle would snap off the hydraulic line in short order if the line had no give.||||reg||1
